Package: fdachange
Title: Epidemic Change-Point Tests for Functional Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Karolis", "Bartkus", email = "karolis.bartkus@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Weighted scan tests for epidemic (changed-segment) alternatives
    in scalar and functional data: an antisymmetric-kernel (Wilcoxon-type)
    scan, an Lp-type scan of the weighted empirical process, a kernel
    mean-embedding (RKHS) scan, and the CUSUM-type statistic of Birbilas
    (2025). Provides Hoelder-type weighting, precomputed Monte-Carlo critical
    values with on-demand simulators, the closed-form Kuiper null for the
    unweighted Wilcoxon scan, functional-to-scalar projections, curve
    reconstruction (smoothing) helpers, and the benchmark data-generating
    scenarios from Bartkus (2026).
